# Line endings: a text file is stored with LF and checked out with LF on every platform, whatever
# core.autocrlf says. A file stored with CRLF before this rule keeps its endings (text=auto never
# renormalises a file that has CRLF in the index); scripts/research/eol.py keeps them on an edit.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.gz binary
*.dat binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
